@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### 初始化资料
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog

### 创建订单；将响应的 id 与 lines[0].id 填入下方变量
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"supplierCode":"SUP-001","lines":[{"materialCode":"PCB-001","quantity":10,"unitPrice":2.5}]}

### 手工替换为上一步返回值
@orderId = REPLACE_WITH_ORDER_ID
@lineId = REPLACE_WITH_ORDER_LINE_ID

### 提交
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-orders/{{orderId}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{"actor":"buyer-demo"}

### 审批
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-orders/{{orderId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{"actor":"approver-demo"}

### 分批收货；相同内容重发不会重复入库，新一笔收货需更换 requestId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-orders/{{orderId}}/receipts
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"90240ace-fdd6-44f5-88bd-7a12ed36a001","warehouseCode":"RM-01","actor":"warehouse-demo","lines":[{"orderLineId":"{{lineId}}","quantity":4}]}

### 库存余额应为 4
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/balances

### 库存流水应只有一笔
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/ledger
